    <data key="d0">DBS Bank Serverless Compute Grid Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Serverless compute grid architecture at DBS Bank using Amazon SQS, AWS Lambda, Amazon EFS, Amazon S3, DynamoDB, and OpenSearch for exotic option trade pricing.</data>
